# OpenRouter API key for AI enrichment.
#
# OPTIONAL: the tool builds decks without a key (the source's own example
# sentences are always kept). With a key you get 1-2 *extra* AI-generated
# example sentences per term and paraphrased answer variants.
#
# Free models work: openai/gpt-oss-20b:free, meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct:free
# Get a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys
#
# Usage:
#   set -a; source .env; set +a     # or export it in your shell profile
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
